intro='''# Section 3 — eleven targeted rerun contracts\n\nBrowser PM → Sam, @relativityE. **PREPARATION ONLY — no run dispatched or observation invented.** Sam retains scheduling, fixture/window selection, source/release authority and the authoritative15-case ledger. These contracts supply acceptance evidence, not a parallel ledger.\n\n**Case15 comes first: deadline20 October2026 at15:30UTC.** Sam-reported trial expiry15:30:14 is not grace; select and finish an approved eligible-fixture window before the conservative15:30:00 deadline. Missing that window is a fixture/deadline HOLD, not permission to extend a trial or mutate an account.\n\nEvery contract inherits full source+served release, workflow/attempt/job, private approved account/window, take/session/page/document/phase and per-request/attempt/terminal bindings in RERUN_CONTRACTS.json. Actual candidate/run/result fields remain unselected/null. Before dispatch Sam must bind exact merged source, canary and observed served SHA/configuration/model identity with timestamps; source ACCEPT alone does not authorize runtime work. No new provider/live/account operation is authorized here.\n\nFixtures reuse exact401 manifest (hashes in JSON); original fixtures remain unchanged: Open Mic45.7s (7f4d6bb6…), full Focus46.2s (528cac3c…), partial Focus22s (8a2bdb57…). These are synthetic engineering fixtures; H1–H6 supply separate real usefulness, filler, permission and device acceptance. Never shorten full useful Open Mic/Focus to a partial shortcut.\n\nKnown violated behavior is FAIL/RETURN; unknown/unobserved proof is HOLD. Provider429 does not by itself distinguish quota exhaustion from rate limiting. Provider timeouts/5xx or truthful degradation may be separately EXTERNAL under the accepted request-bound contract; none proves useful coaching. Unanswered/unknown-cost calls stay unresolved rather than silently replayed. Retain original outcomes and append each new receipt.\n\nFresh reference boundary: #1664 served83029ebb is credited from Sam's canary/served receipt; #1665 bounded cap correction2f10a057 source accepted, runtime separate; #1666 old34bb2c31 now HOLD for existing J2 assertion per CLI13:51. App's case4 77780845 was local/unpublished at13:45. These dated facts are prerequisites to refresh, not future assignments.\n\n'''
md=intro
